# frozen_string_literal: true

# Loaded by Redmine's Gemfile. Nothing is added here: the plugin is a gem
# line in Redmine's Gemfile.local (docs/setup.md#installation), so that
# Bundler.require loads boot/redmine_aws_ssm.rb before the application's
# configuration. With the gem, Bundler installs the plugin's files, so the
# line can only be there; a checkout uses the same line with a path.
# Declaring the plugin here as well would make Bundler refuse it as one gem
# from two sources.
